{"id":"dash-in-the-bath","title":"Dash in the Bath","level":1,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"5b8f972493ed3275ac68f3cc58c2052b","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["bath","soap","foam","duck","splash","shock"],"common":["the","he","of","no","puts","me"],"challenge":["rubber","bigger"],"before":"Have you ever had too many bubbles in the bath? What do you think will happen?","after":["What made the foam get so big?","How did they find Dash?","Why did Dad slip?","What was the funniest part?"],"retell":[2,4,7,11,14,15],"pages":[{"text":"It is bath night for Dash.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"4399270b8cf56f84529d28d8b7a861e6","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A warm family bathroom in the evening: a white bath filling from the tap, a yellow rubber duck, toothbrushes in a cup, fluffy towels.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash hops in. Splash!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"4eeb3b98b231521f568e0d364d496b4b","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash cannonballs into the bath and a big splash of water flies up.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"He sits on a rubber duck.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c6c33d6eca3a0343069be402e556f6aa","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash floats proudly on top of a big yellow rubber duck like a ship's captain, one arm raised.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia puts in lots of soap.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"4f0f6f271bb7c25165b0f34f3d79f964","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia squeezes a big bottle of bubble bath into the water and the first foam starts to rise.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Foam! Foam! The foam gets big.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"5d4111f127dd836405a177108a56e54f","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A mountain of fluffy white foam rises above the bath.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It gets bigger and bigger!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"63da1adafe4eb450ab44a45374790bee","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The foam spills over the sides of the bath onto the floor and keeps growing like a cloud.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The foam fills the room!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"1ffe65a57f7713a435155e6961e47422","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The whole bathroom is filled with foam up to the children's chins; only their heads stick out.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But Dash is lost in the foam!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"3c170d278f34ad10c8eeeb69bbae4045","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia look around in the sea of foam, worried.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan digs in the foam. No Dash.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"200bbdf01efe6e69fda6653232dd2f79","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan scoops big armfuls of foam, searching, foam on his nose.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia digs in the foam. No Dash.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"2921169a65c5edde98af695eb5f1ab01","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia searches the foam with both hands, a little foam beard on her chin.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then a tail pops up. Then a big grin!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"2301ccb13084cafe46bb0b1a24abd596","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Out of the foam pops a little turquoise-green tail, and next to it Dash's big grinning face appears.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash has a foam hat and a foam beard!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"688620e0194db77a633f4153b6b60d67","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up of Dash proudly wearing a tall white foam top hat and a long white foam beard, like a tiny wizard.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then Dad looks in. He gets a shock!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"581a6ff1159eda6378b33a6f4c392a5a","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad opens the bathroom door and a wave of foam pours out around his legs.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad slips on the foam...","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"33819991388daaf7ba06e04c3ddc3363","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad slips on the foam, legs in the air and arms flailing, in a funny cartoon pose.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"SPLASH! Now Dad is in the bath!","bubble":{"who":"dad","name":"Dad","text":"Is it bath night for me too?","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"1d266370eda793bb4ed7f3b6c4abfc16","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad sits in the bath fully dressed in his clothes, covered in foam, with a foam hat and foam beard just like Dash.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}